==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 3~8 seconds<sup>90f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Project A]] spawns.
