==Strategy==
If you have your [[Cats of the Cosmos]] [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], you can just rush this one with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and generic rusher units.

Even without them, this stage is fairly straightforward since only one Super Metal Hippoe spawns, also the three Project As are automatically synced up from the get-go. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]] is recommended to kill off the Trolly Bloggers so your anti-Metals can approach Super Metal Hippoe unhindered. Just stall out the peons until Super Metal Hippoe spawns, lure him to the Cat Base, then overwhelm him with your best Critical Hitters.

After that, generic backliners like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can finish off the Project As.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress Cat]] - Waitress's slow but guaranteed high-damage Crits can easily cripple if not defeat Super Metal Hippoe outright.

